---
id: journey_cargo_problem
title: Cargo Emergency
tags: [danger, cargo]
context: journey
weight: 14
cooldown: 3
requires:
  cargoTags: [volatile]
---

=== intro

Alarms blare. Something in the cargo bay is destabilizing—the volatile isotopes are fluctuating beyond safe parameters. Containment field failing.

You have seconds to decide. A breach could turn the Holdfast into a brief, bright star.

* [Emergency vent the cargo]
  ~ removeCargoByTag volatile 99
  ~ chronicle "Cargo Jettisoned"
    We vented the unstable cargo before it could breach containment. Credits lost, but we're alive to earn more.
  -> END

* [Attempt to stabilize] { crew.engineering }
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ chronicle "Crisis Averted"
    The engineer managed to stabilize the cargo. Hands steady, voice calm, life saved. Worth every credit we pay them.
  -> END

* [Do nothing and pray]
  ~ damage hull 18
  ~ damage morale 12
  ~ chronicle "Containment Breach"
    The cargo blew. We survived—barely. The hull screams where it shouldn't bend. But we fly on.
  -> END
